WEBVTT

00:02:58.601 --> 00:03:00.996
So that's a very important function

00:03:00.996 --> 00:03:02.452
tied in with the Nanopatch.

00:03:02.452 --> 00:03:04.699
Now we make the Nanopatch

00:03:04.699 --> 00:03:07.236
with a technique

00:03:07.236 --> 00:03:09.615
called deep reactive ion etching.

00:03:09.615 --> 00:03:11.659
And this particular technique 
is one that's been borrowed

00:03:11.659 --> 00:03:13.286
from the semiconductor industry,

00:03:13.286 --> 00:03:15.122
and therefore is low cost

00:03:15.122 --> 00:03:17.316
and can be rolled out in large numbers.

00:03:17.316 --> 00:03:22.382
Now we dry-coat vaccines to 
the projections of the Nanopatch

00:03:22.382 --> 00:03:24.201
and apply it to the skin.

00:03:24.201 --> 00:03:28.757
Now, the simplest form of application

00:03:28.757 --> 00:03:30.779
is using our finger,